        "Abstract": "Recent advances in deep learning have improved abstractive summarization systems. This paper presents FREDSum, a dataset of French political debates for dialogue summarization. The dataset consists of manually transcribed and annotated debates, covering various topics and perspectives. The paper highlights the importance of high-quality transcription and annotations for training accurate dialogue summarization models."
